  "chain": "dropped floor tile -> vibration actuates TD-50 -> 230kV Bus 1 isolated/loss of voltage -> KD-10 actuates per design (parallel: bus loss also drops B Train ES bus/4160V buses) -> KD-10+mis-set KC-2 [legacy relay setpoint error, TBD cause] complete trip circuit -> generator/turbine trip -> automatic reactor trip -> (parallel: fast bus transfer fails -> RCPs deenergized) -> reactor trip with RCPs deenergized, RHR via natural circulation [backups: AFW auto-start, 1B EDG auto-start]",
